# Copy this file and name the copy `.env.local` (no `.example` on the end).
#
#   Windows PowerShell:  copy .env.example .env.local
#   Mac / Linux:         cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Then fill in the blank below. NEVER commit your .env.local — it is in
# .gitignore so git will ignore it for you, but don't fight that.

# Clerk is what puts the sign-in and sign-up buttons in the header. Without
# this key the whole page fails to draw — not just the buttons — because
# ClerkProvider wraps the entire app and refuses to start without it.
#
# Ask Alif for the key, or get your own from the project's Clerk dashboard:
# https://dashboard.clerk.com/ -> API keys -> Publishable key
#
# "Publishable" means it is safe in the browser. Vite bundles every VITE_
# variable into the JavaScript it ships, so ONLY publishable values go here.
# A Clerk *secret* key must never appear in this file.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
